(7785992, 1292214, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> It took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at, and I think that was probably what voters struggled with on this particular entry.  I do believe you met the parameters of the challenge.
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> I think this one really needs a defined subject.  Without reading the title, something I seldomly do during voting, it is difficult to understand what you were shooting here.  It is still in an interesting image, I just think it could use some definition.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> I did not vote in this challenge, but, after looking through the challenge results, this one probably would have been a 4 or 5 for me.  I do not think that it was a last place finish, but the score was probably pretty close to appropriate.  Thanks for sharing.
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: It took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at, and I think that was probably what voters struggled with on this particular entry.  I do believe you met the parameters of the challenge.

My ideas for improvement:  I think this one really needs a defined subject.  Without reading the title, something I seldomly do during voting, it is difficult to understand what you were shooting here.  It is still in an interesting image, I just think it could use some definition.

Where I would have/did score this entry: I did not vote in this challenge, but, after looking through the challenge results, this one probably would have been a 4 or 5 for me.  I do not think that it was a last place finish, but the score was probably pretty close to appropriate.  Thanks for sharing.

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-04 10:08:57.000000', NULL, 0);
